    "passage": "SWIFTLANE AIRPORT SHUTTLE — YOUR STRESS-FREE RIDE TO THE TERMINAL\n\nWhy pay for airport parking or rely on unpredictable rideshares? SwiftLane operates comfortable, air-conditioned shuttles between downtown Belmont and Belmont International Airport every 30 minutes, from 4:00 A.M. to 11:30 P.M., 365 days a year.\n\nOur shuttles depart from three convenient pickup points: Central Station (Bay 6), the Royal Belmont Hotel, and the Crosstown Mall transit plaza. Travel time to the airport is approximately 35 minutes, and every vehicle offers free Wi-Fi, USB charging ports, and space for two large suitcases per passenger. Additional luggage may be brought for a $5 fee per item, space permitting.\n\nA one-way adult ticket costs $18, and a round-trip ticket is just $30 when booked through our mobile app. Children under twelve ride for half price, and infants under two travel free on an adult's lap. Frequent flyers should consider our SwiftPass: ten one-way rides for $140, valid for a full year and transferable to family members.\n\nBook your seat at swiftlaneshuttle.com, on our app, or by calling 555-0162. Passengers who book at least 24 hours in advance are guaranteed a seat; walk-up passengers are accommodated on a first-come, first-served basis. Group reservations of eight or more receive a 10 percent discount and a dedicated luggage trailer upon request.",
