    "passage": "TASTE THE SEASON AT ORCHARD LANE FARM MARKET\n\nCelebrate autumn at Orchard Lane Farm Market, open every Friday, Saturday, and Sunday in October from 9 A.M. to 5 P.M. at 1400 County Road 12, just fifteen minutes from downtown Westfield.\n\nPick your own apples from our twelve varieties, including the rare Honeyglow, available only during the first two weekends of the month. Pre-picked baskets are sold at the barn for visitors who prefer to skip the orchard walk. Our farm kitchen serves fresh cider doughnuts, apple pies baked daily, and hot mulled cider — and this year, for the first time, all kitchen items can be ordered ahead online for pickup at the express window.\n\nFamilies will love the hay maze, pony rides, and weekend pumpkin-painting workshops, included free with admission. Admission is $6 per person; children under three enter free. Picked apples are weighed at the exit and cost $1.80 per pound, with a 10 percent discount on quantities over twenty pounds.\n\nGroup visits from schools and senior centers are welcome on Fridays with a reservation made at least one week in advance; groups of fifteen or more receive discounted admission of $4 per person and a guided orchard tour at no extra cost. Free parking is available on site, and leashed dogs are welcome everywhere except the farm kitchen. For weather updates and the daily picking schedule, follow us at @OrchardLaneFarm or visit orchardlanefarm.com.",
