    "passage": "MEMO\n\nTo: All employees, Westfield Corporate Campus\nFrom: Sandra Okonkwo, Facilities Manager\nDate: April 3\nSubject: Parking lot resurfacing, April 14–18\n\nPlease be advised that the main parking lot adjacent to Building A will be closed for resurfacing from Monday, April 14, through Friday, April 18. The lot will reopen at 6:00 A.M. on Monday, April 21. This project will repair winter weather damage and add twelve new spaces, including four equipped with electric vehicle charging stations.\n\nDuring the closure, employees may park in the overflow lot on Dunmore Street, a five-minute walk from campus, or in the parking garage at 22 Fairfax Avenue, where the company has reserved 150 spaces. To use the garage, show your employee badge at the entrance. A shuttle will run between the garage and Building A every fifteen minutes from 7:00 A.M. to 9:30 A.M. and from 4:00 P.M. to 6:30 P.M.\n\nEmployees who carpool with at least two colleagues may continue to use the small lot behind Building C, which is unaffected by the work. Visitors should be directed to the Fairfax Avenue garage; please notify the front desk in advance so that guest passes can be prepared.\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for your patience. Questions may be sent to facilities@westfieldcorp.com.",
