    "passage": "BROCKTON INSTITUTE — PROJECT MANAGEMENT CERTIFICATE COURSE\n\nDevelop the skills employers want! Our popular certificate course covers project planning, budgeting, risk management, and team leadership. Classes are held online every Tuesday from 7:00 to 9:00 P.M. for eight weeks, beginning September 9. The course fee is $400; however, participants who register by August 15 pay the early registration price of $340. Course materials will be e-mailed to participants one week before the first class. To earn the certificate, participants must attend at least seven of the eight sessions and pass a final assessment. Register at www.brocktoninstitute.org.\n\n--- Passage 2 ---\n\nTo: h.ali@trentlogistics.com\nFrom: registration@brocktoninstitute.org\nDate: August 10\nSubject: Registration confirmed\n\nDear Mr. Ali,\n\nThank you for registering for the Project Management Certificate Course. Your payment of $340 has been processed, and your place in the course is confirmed. As stated on our Web site, your course materials will arrive by e-mail one week before the first session. You asked whether missing a single class in October because of a business trip would prevent you from earning the certificate. Please rest assured that it will not, as long as you attend all of the remaining sessions and pass the final assessment. We recommend asking a classmate for notes from any session you miss.\n\nBest regards,\nBrockton Institute Registration Team",
