    "part": 7,
    "type": "RC",
    "question": "Why did Mr. Tan write the email?",
    "passage": "To: Nadia Petrov <n.petrov@silvanmedicalsupply.com>\nFrom: Oliver Tan <o.tan@ridgeviewdental.org>\nDate: July 8\nSubject: Order #RD-3047 — partial backorder\n\nDear Ms. Petrov,\n\nThank you for the prompt delivery of most of order #RD-3047, which arrived at Ridgeview Dental Group this morning. However, the packing list indicates that two items—the ultrasonic cleaning solution (item #US-220, six bottles) and the sterilization pouches (item #SP-114, ten boxes)—are on backorder until July 29.\n\nUnfortunately, our current stock of sterilization pouches will last only until about July 18, and we cannot operate without them. Could you let me know whether a partial quantity, even two or three boxes, could be shipped sooner? Alternatively, if you can recommend a comparable product that is in stock, we would consider substituting it for this order only, provided the unit price does not exceed what we originally agreed to pay.\n\nThe cleaning solution is less urgent, as we have enough on hand for roughly five weeks, so the July 29 date poses no problem there.\n\nWe have been ordering from Silvan for over six years and appreciate the consistently reliable service. I would be grateful for a reply by Thursday so that we can contact another supplier if necessary.\n\nBest regards,\nOliver Tan\nOffice Manager, Ridgeview Dental Group",
