    "passage": "Clinic Staff Chat — Maple Grove Dental\n\nDr. Susan Akintola (8:05 A.M.)\nTeam, our X-ray unit failed its startup check again. The technician from Meditech can't come until Thursday. We have nine patients booked today.\n\nRobbie Calhoun (8:08 A.M.)\nLooking at the list now. Four are cleanings only — no imaging needed. Two are new-patient exams, which always include X-rays. The rest are follow-ups.\n\nDr. Susan Akintola (8:10 A.M.)\nFollow-ups for Mr. Otieno and Mrs. Vega can use last month's images; those were taken for the same treatment plans. Who's the third follow-up?\n\nRobbie Calhoun (8:12 A.M.)\nMs. Whitcombe, the cracked molar. Dr. Akintola, you noted \"new image required before crown prep\" in her chart.\n\nDr. Susan Akintola (8:14 A.M.)\nThen she can't be seen today. Robbie, call her first — she's driving in from Ashford, almost an hour away.\n\nHana Mori (8:16 A.M.)\nWhat about the two new patients? Riverside Dental over on 5th Street has the same imaging system. Dr. Pierce there owes me — we lent them our portable unit during their renovation.\n\nDr. Susan Akintola (8:18 A.M.)\nAsk, Hana. If Riverside takes our imaging today, the new patients keep their slots, and we just walk the files over.\n\nHana Mori (8:25 A.M.)\nDr. Pierce said yes — send patients at 10:30 and 11:15, images transferred within the hour.\n\nDr. Susan Akintola (8:27 A.M.)\nExcellent teamwork. Robbie, update the schedule and note everything for the front desk.",
