    "type": "RC",
    "question": "For whom is the training program designed?",
    "passage": "www.brightonlanguage.com/business\n\nCORPORATE LANGUAGE TRAINING — BRIGHTON LANGUAGE ACADEMY\n\nHelp your team communicate confidently with international clients. Brighton Language Academy designs customized language programs for businesses of every size, delivered at your office, at our Welford campus, or live online.\n\nOur Process:\n1. Needs Assessment — A program coordinator meets with your management team to identify goals, such as negotiation skills or customer-facing vocabulary.\n2. Level Testing — Each participating employee completes a 40-minute online placement test.\n3. Custom Curriculum — Our instructional designers build a course around your industry, using real documents from your workplace where possible.\n4. Progress Reporting — Managers receive attendance records and skills summaries every four weeks.\n\nPrograms run in 12-week blocks, with groups of four to eight employees per instructor. Pricing starts at $2,800 per group block for online delivery; on-site instruction adds $400 per block. A 10% discount applies when a company enrolls three or more groups in the same block.\n\nOur corporate clients include logistics firms, hotels, and software companies across the region. As space for the autumn block is limited to fifteen groups, we encourage interested companies to request a consultation by August 8 at corporate@brightonlanguage.com.",
