    "passage": "FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE — EMBARGOED UNTIL AUGUST 25\n\nMeridian Foods to Open Production Facility in Dayton\n\nMeridian Foods announced today that it will open a 40,000-square-meter production facility in Dayton, creating approximately 250 full-time jobs over the next two years. \"This investment reflects our commitment to regional growth,\" said Chief Executive Officer Karen Whitfield. An opening ceremony will be held at the site on September 9, and full production is expected to begin in October. Members of the press should direct all inquiries to Media Relations Manager Olivia Cheng at o.cheng@meridianfoods.com.\n\n--- Passage 2 ---\n\nTo: o.cheng@meridianfoods.com\nFrom: Trent Kowalski <t.kowalski@daytonledger.com>\nDate: August 22\nSubject: Coverage of the Dayton announcement\n\nDear Ms. Cheng,\n\nI received your company's announcement this morning and would like to write a feature story for the Dayton Ledger. Would it be possible to arrange a 20-minute telephone interview with Ms. Whitfield sometime this week? I would also appreciate any high-resolution photographs of the facility design. Our editor hopes to publish the story in this Sunday's edition on August 24, ahead of our competitors. Please let me know if that schedule presents any difficulty.\n\nSincerely,\nTrent Kowalski, Business Reporter",
