    "passage": "To: Naomi Castellan <n.castellan@authormail.com>\nFrom: Theo Brandt <t.brandt@aldergatepress.com>\nSubject: Production Schedule for The Salt Garden\nDate: February 11\n\nDear Naomi,\n\nIt was a pleasure speaking with you last week. As promised, here is the production timeline for your novel, The Salt Garden, now that the manuscript has been accepted.\n\nOur copyeditor, Rosa Lindqvist, will send you her edited file by March 6. You will then have three weeks to review her changes and respond to queries; please note that this stage is the last opportunity to make substantial revisions to the text. After that point, changes will be limited to correcting typographical errors, as alterations during typesetting are costly and can delay printing.\n\nCover design concepts will be shared in mid-April. While we welcome your input, final approval of the cover rests with our art director, as stipulated in clause 9 of your contract. Advance reader copies will go out to reviewers in July, ahead of the planned October 14 publication date.\n\nFinally, our publicity team would like to schedule a call in early May to discuss bookstore events in your area. Could you let me know your availability for the first week of that month?\n\nWarm regards,\nTheo Brandt\nSenior Editor, Aldergate Press",
