    "passage": "To: Lydia Moreau <lmoreau@hartwellmail.com>\nFrom: Sunpath Energy Programs <programs@sunpathpower.com>\nSubject: Your Solar Rebate Application — Approved with Conditions\nDate: June 19\n\nDear Ms. Moreau,\n\nCongratulations! Your application for the Residential Solar Incentive Program has been approved. Based on the 6.4-kilowatt system proposed for your home at 88 Cobble Hill Road, you qualify for a rebate of $3,840, payable after installation is verified.\n\nPlease note the following conditions. The installation must be performed by a contractor on our certified installer list, which is updated monthly on our website; work completed by uncertified installers is not eligible for the rebate. Installation must be finished within 180 days of this notice, and an inspection by our technical team must be scheduled within 30 days of completion. Finally, the rebate is issued as a credit on your electricity account rather than as a check, and any unused balance carries forward to subsequent billing cycles.\n\nOne item in your file requires attention: the roof assessment you submitted is more than twelve months old. Please arrange an updated assessment and upload the report to your application portal before work begins. Many certified installers provide this service at no charge when they prepare a final quote.\n\nWe look forward to verifying your completed system.\n\nSunpath Energy Programs Team",
