    "question": "What is the main purpose of the e-mail?",
    "passage": "To: Wholesale Account Holders\nFrom: Nordica Pharmaceuticals Distribution <wholesale@nordicapharma.com>\nSubject: Ordering Deadlines and Holiday Logistics — December\nDate: November 20\n\nDear Account Holder,\n\nTo help your pharmacy maintain adequate stock through the holiday period, please review the following ordering arrangements for December.\n\nOur distribution centers will operate normally through December 19. Orders placed by 2:00 P.M. on that date will ship the same day. From December 22 to January 2, the centers will run with reduced staffing: orders will ship within three business days instead of one, and Saturday deliveries will be suspended. Normal service resumes January 5.\n\nWe strongly encourage placing your principal December order by December 12. Last year, orders submitted during the final week before the holidays were thirty percent larger on average than normal, and several products — particularly pediatric fever reducers and cold remedies — sold out at the wholesale level. Accounts that ordered early received full allocations, while later orders were partially filled.\n\nFor urgent patient-specific needs during the reduced-service period, our emergency line at 555-0186 will operate daily, including holidays, from 8:00 A.M. to 8:00 P.M. Emergency orders are limited to medically necessary items and ship by courier at no extra charge — a service we provide at cost because patient care comes first.\n\nFinally, please verify your delivery address and receiving hours in the account portal by December 1, as holiday staffing changes at your location may affect delivery acceptance.\n\nNordica Pharmaceuticals Distribution Team",
