    "question": "What should a customer do if an ingredient is missing?",
    "passage": "www.greencrate.com/faq --- Frequently Asked Questions. Q: Can I change my menu after subscribing? A: Yes. You may switch among our four menus at any time, and you can mix recipes from different menus within a single box. Q: What if I am not home when my box arrives? A: No signature is required. Our couriers will leave the box at your door, and the insulated liner keeps ingredients fresh for up to twelve hours. If your box arrives damaged or an ingredient is missing, report it through your account within 48 hours of delivery, and we will credit your next order. Q: Do you accommodate food allergies? A: Each recipe card lists all ingredients and highlights common allergens in bold. However, our kits are packed in a facility that handles nuts, dairy, and wheat, so we cannot guarantee that any kit is completely allergen-free. Q: How do I earn referral rewards? A: Share your personal referral link; when a friend completes a first order of $40 or more, you receive a $25 credit and your friend receives $15 off. Credits expire 90 days after they are issued and cannot be applied to shipping fees.",
