    "id": "p7-1517",
    "part": 7,
    "type": "RC",
    "question": "Why was the notice issued?",
    "passage": "HARTWELL SAVINGS BANK — IMPORTANT ACCOUNT NOTICE\n\nDear Customers,\n\nBeginning September 1, a $2.00 monthly fee will apply to each checking or savings account that receives a mailed paper statement. Customers who switch to electronic statements will continue to receive their account records at no charge. Electronic statements are posted to online banking on the first business day of each month and are stored for seven years.\n\nThe paper statement fee will be automatically waived for account holders aged 65 or older and for all Premium Advantage account holders. No action is needed for customers in these groups.\n\nTo avoid the fee, log in to online banking, select Statement Preferences, and choose Electronic Delivery by August 25. Customers who enroll by that date will also be entered into a drawing for one of ten $100 gift cards. If you need assistance with enrollment, please visit any branch or call 555-0188.\n\nThank you for banking with Hartwell Savings.",
