    "type": "RC",
    "question": "Why was the letter sent?",
    "passage": "Glenfield Post Office\n2 Station Road, Glenfield\n\nJuly 10\n\nDear Box Holder,\n\nOur records indicate that the six-month rental period for Post Office Box 412 will end on July 31. To keep your box without interruption, please renew by July 24. Renewals received between July 25 and July 31 will be processed with a $10 late-handling charge. If no renewal is received by August 10, the box will be closed, the lock will be reset, and any mail addressed to the box will be returned to senders.\n\nRenewal options are as follows: six months for $56 or twelve months for $102. Payment may be made online at glenfieldpost.gov/boxes, at the retail counter during business hours, or by check mailed to the address above. Please write your box number on all payments.\n\nCustomers who renew for twelve months will also receive two months of free package alerts by text message.\n\nThank you for using our box rental service.\n\nCarl Jensen\nRetail Services Supervisor",
