    "passage": "OFFICETECH SOLUTIONS — EQUIPMENT LEASE SUMMARY\nClient: Brennan & Slate Architects | Agreement no. 7741\nLease term: 36 months, beginning March 1\nEquipment: Four MX-900 multifunction printers (print, scan, copy)\nMonthly payment: $480, due on the first of each month\nIncluded: All toner cartridges; on-site repairs within one business day of a service request; a replacement unit if a repair takes longer than three business days.\nNot included: Paper; damage caused by use of non-approved supplies.\nUpgrade clause: After 18 months, the client may exchange any unit for a newer model for an additional $25 per unit per month.\nService requests: Call 555-0142 or e-mail service@officetechsol.com.\n\n--- Passage 2 ---\nTo: service@officetechsol.com\nFrom: Tomas Ruiz <t.ruiz@brennanslate.com>\nSubject: Service request — Agreement 7741\nDate: November 10\n\nHello,\nI am writing about two matters. First, the MX-900 in our third-floor studio has jammed repeatedly since Friday, November 7, and this morning it stopped printing entirely. Under our agreement, I expect a technician on-site by tomorrow at the latest; please confirm the visit time. Given that the machine has already been out of service for one business day, I would also like to know at what point we become entitled to a replacement unit. Second, our lease began on March 1 of last year, so I believe we have now passed the 18-month mark. Could you send details and pricing for exchanging two of our units for the newer MX-1100 model?\nThank you,\nTomas Ruiz, Office Manager",
